cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ulam OPDP Difficulty Atlas"
type: dataset
version: "1.7.0-opdp-1.0-append-only"
date-released: 2026-09-08
authors:
  - family-names: "Zarzuelo Urdiales"
    given-names: "Alejandro"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandrozu/ulam-opdp-difficulty-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/alejandrozu/ulam-opdp-difficulty-atlas"
abstract: >-
  Auditable Open Problem Difficulty Profiles for 102,563 records, preserving
  all 15,458 records from the append-only UnsolvedMath v1.6 release and
  appending 87,105 MathDB public-catalog records frozen on 2026-09-08. The
  MathDB additions use source-provided public-list excerpts rather than full
  statements and are explicitly provisional, flagged for recalibration, and
  capped at C0 confidence. Prepared by Alejandro Zarzuelo Urdiales with
  ChatGPT 5.6 Sol.
keywords:
  - open problems
  - mathematics
  - artificial intelligence
  - difficulty assessment
  - UnsolvedMath
  - OPDP
  - Oberwolfach Reports
  - MathDB
  - source-aware analysis
